...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }
agent: 컨설턴트 에이전트 { class: ours }
wrapper: 안전 래퍼 { class: ours }
search_tool: 검색 도구 { class: ours }
perplexity: Perplexity API { class: ext }

agent -> wrapper: perplexity_search 호출 위임
wrapper -> search_tool: 함수 호출
search_tool -> perplexity: POST /chat/completions
perplexity -> search_tool: JSON 응답 (content, citations)
search_tool -> wrapper: dict 반환
wrapper -> agent: bytes 없는 dict 반환
agent -> gemini: function_response 전달, 다음 추론 요청
